  "statement_html": "Pour étudier une courbe paramétrée, on est amené à étudier deux fonctions\t\\(f\\) et \\(g\\) qui représentent l'abscisse et l'ordonnée des points de cette courbe.\t<br>\t\tCalculer les dérivées puis construire le tableau de variations des fonctions \\(f\\)et \\(g\\) définies sur \\(\\lbrack-2 ; 9\\rbrack\\) par\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(f(t) = - t^{2} + 5 t - 2\\) et \\(g(t) = - 2 t^{2} - 4 t - 7\\) . </div>\t<br>\tOn demande les valeurs <strong>exactes</strong> de \\(t\\), de \\(f{\\left(t \\right)}\\)et de \\(g{\\left(t \\right)}\\) (pour les fractions, utiliser /).\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(f'(t) =\\)  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"40\"></span></div>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(g'(t) =\\)  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"40\"></span></div>\t\t \t<table class=\"wimscenter wimsborder mytabvar\">\t<tr>\t<th> \\(t\\)</th><td>\\(-2\\)</td><td></td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td></td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply20\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td></td><td>\\(9\\)</td>\t</tr><tr>\t<th>\\(f'(t)\\)</th><td></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply4\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot> </td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply9\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply5\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot></td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply24\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply21\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot></td><td></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<th>\\(f{\\left(t \\right)}\\)</th><td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply10\" data-size=\"5\"></span> </td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply6\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot> </td><td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply7\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot></td><td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply23\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply22\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot></td><td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply11\" data-size=\"5\"></span> </td>\t</tr><tr>\t<th> \\(g'(t)\\)</th><td></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply12\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot> </td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply17\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply13\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot></td><td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply28\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply25\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot></td><td></td>\t</tr><tr>\t<th>\\(g{\\left(t \\right)}\\)</th><td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply18\" data-size=\"5\"></span> </td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply14\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot> </td><td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply16\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply15\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot></td><td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply27\" data-size=\"5\"></span></td><td>  <cf-slot name=\"reply26\" data-index=\"0\" data-w=\"10\"></cf-slot></td><td>  <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply19\" data-size=\"5\"></span> </td>\t</tr>\t</table>\t ",
